<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<article class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose legal">
    <p class="legal-note">We keep our policies short and in plain language. If anything is unclear, write to us and we will help.</p>
    <% if (kind === 'privacy') { %>
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="h2">Privacy notice</h1>
    <p>Goforge Digital (“we”) is run by <%= BRAND.founder %>, <%= BRAND.founderRole %>, from <%= BRAND.address.line1 %>, <%= BRAND.address.line2 %>, <%= BRAND.address.region %>, India. The legal name on invoices is <span class="blank">[legal name of the business, if different from Goforge Digital]</span>. GSTIN: <span class="blank">[GSTIN, or “not registered”]</span>.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">What we collect, and why</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Project form: your name, phone, business name and message, so we can reply about a project.</li>
      <li>Internship form: your name, college, course and year, phone number, programme and note, so we can consider an application and reply.</li>
      <li>If you later pay a fee or a deposit: the payment reference your bank or UPI app shows us. We do not store card numbers on this website.</li>
      <li>Technical logs of the site (such as IP address) for security and rate limits, kept with the hosting provider.</li>
      <li>Analytics, only if it has been switched on: which pages were opened. It is off until an analytics ID is set in the server environment.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell this information. We do not use it for ads about other companies.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Who else sees it</h2>
    <p>The studio, and the host that stores the database.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>Enquiries and applications are kept for <span class="blank">[retention period — suggested: 24 months after the last message]</span>, or sooner if you ask us to delete them, unless we have to keep a record for a legal claim or a payment.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask for a copy, a correction, or deletion, and you can withdraw consent for us to keep using the details to contact you. Email <%= s.email %> or write to the address above. We aim to answer within <span class="blank">[number of days — suggested: 30]</span>. If you are not satisfied, you can complain to the Data Protection Board of India once that route is open to you.</p>
    <p>This programme is designed for college students aged 18 and above.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Grievance contact</h2>
    <p><%= BRAND.founder %>, <%= BRAND.founderRole %>, <%= s.email %>, <%= s.phone1 %>.</p>
    <% } else if (kind === 'terms') { %>
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
    <h1 class="h2">Terms of use</h1>
    <p>The site goforgedigital.com describes the studio’s services and internship. It explains what we offer and how to get started.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Projects</h2>
    <p>Client work starts only after you accept a written scope and a price. The free website and WhatsApp check is a complimentary review with recommendations. Who owns the finished work is written in that scope. Until a scope says otherwise, <span class="blank">[who owns the code and the design — suggested: you own the work you paid for, we may keep a copy as a portfolio piece only with your permission]</span>.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Internship</h2>
    <p>Training and the internship are two stages. The fee and dates are confirmed on a call. Your seat is confirmed on enrolment. Our training certificate and internship letter are accepted by colleges and recognised by industry, and we can provide college-specific formats on request.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">The site</h2>
    <p>Please use the forms for genuine enquiries and share only your own details. The law of India applies. Courts at <span class="blank">[city — suggested: Faridabad, Haryana]</span> are the suggested venue.</p>
    <% } else { %>
    <p class="eyebrow">Refunds</p>
    <h1 class="h2">Refunds</h1>
    <p>Our refund terms are designed to be fair and simple.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Free offers</h2>
    <p>The demo class and the website and WhatsApp check have no fee, so there is nothing to refund.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Internship fee</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>If Goforge Digital cancels a batch before it starts, fees already paid for that batch are refunded in full.</li>
      <li><span class="blank">[If you cancel before the first live session — suggested: full refund of the fee already paid.]</span></li>
      <li><span class="blank">[If you cancel after attending the first live session — suggested: no refund, because the seat and the session have been used.]</span></li>
      <li>The internship letter is included at no extra charge and is issued when the internship work is completed.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="h3">Client projects</h2>
    <p><span class="blank">[Deposit rule — suggested: a deposit is refundable until work starts. After work starts, you pay for the part already done, and the rest of the deposit is discussed in writing.]</span></p>
    <p>Ask for a refund by email at <%= s.email %>, with the name used on the payment. We reply within <span class="blank">[number of days — suggested: 7]</span>.</p>
    <% } %>
    <p class="legal-links"><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms</a> · <a href="/refund">Refunds</a></p>
  </div>
</article>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
